{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-13","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2016,"subject":"chemistry","number":13,"points":2,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"열화학·엔탈피·엔트로피","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","acid","gas"],"stem":"다음은 25℃에서 산 HA의 해리와 물의 자체 이온화 반응에 대한 \n열화학 반응식이다.\no\nHA(aq)+H2O(l)⇄H3O +(aq)+A −(aq)\nΔH1\no =57.1kJ\n2H2O(l)⇄H3O +(aq)+OH −(aq)\nΔH2\n그림은 HA의 온도에 따른 산 해리 상수(Ka)를 나타낸 것이다.\n25℃에서 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 \n고른 것은? (단, 기체 상수 R=8.31J/mol·K이다.)\n<보 기>\no는 0보다 크다.\nㄱ. ΔH1\nㄴ. HA의 산 해리 반응의 표준 반응 엔트로피(ΔSo)는 0보다 \n크다.\nㄷ. 강염기에 의한 HA의 중화 엔탈피는 (144×8.31×10−3\n+57.1)kJ/mol이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06","fig-07"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":29,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[62.3,5.915,11.6,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-13/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":545,"height":37,"region":0,"bbox":[35.9,51.515,218.0,14.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-13/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":680,"height":38,"region":0,"bbox":[18.7,74.315,272.0,15.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2016-deet-science2-13/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":512,"height":383,"region":0,"bbox":[67.9,150.715,204.8,153.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextIt